  from MAME (third_party/mame/README.md lists them);
- the rest of third_party/ (SLJIT, BSD-2-Clause; RmlUi, MIT, with the MIT libraries it bundles) and
  assets/fonts/ (Barlow Condensed, SIL Open Font License 1.1): each under its own licence, in its folder
  or at the top of its files;
- tools/ref/supermodel-cov.patch: a patch to Supermodel (GPL-3.0, as Supermodel), used only to build
  the reference the port was checked against; nothing of it is in the game;
- the app icon (assets/icon/: icon.png, VF3.icns, VF3.ico, and what tools/release/make_icon.py draws),
